# Production API base URL for the deployed frontend (Vite `vite build`).
#
# VITE_API_URL is inlined into the bundle at BUILD time. Without it,
# axiosClient.ts falls back to the relative "/api/v1", which in production
# resolves against the Vercel origin instead of the backend; vercel.json's
# catch-all rewrite then swallows the POST and answers 405.
#
# This is the deployed Spring Boot origin + the server's context path
# (server.servlet.context-path=/api/v1 in backend/src/main/resources/application.yml).
VITE_API_URL=https://timetable-scheduler-1h21.onrender.com/api/v1